model includes code adapted from org-roam-ui, copyright its contributors,
licensed under GNU GPL version 3. The reviewed upstream revision is recorded in
the adapted source file:

  https://github.com/org-roam/org-roam-ui
  commit 2894dcbf56d2eca8d3cae2b1ae183f51724b5db6

