from James Yu's LaTeX Workshop at commit
57f9e8d0306ea0c7419290a2b62ee0cec3c31041, used under the MIT License. Source
paths and content hashes are recorded in
resources/snippets/tex-mode/generated/.manifest.json. It also includes filtered Overleaf
completion weights and patterns under the AGPL-3.0 license at the revision
listed above.

